{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21695","headline":"酬乐天得微之诗知通州事因成四首 一 · 元稹","name":"酬乐天得微之诗知通州事因成四首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茅檐屋舍竹篱州，虎怕偏蹄虵两头。\n暗蛊有时迷酒影，浮尘向日似波流。\n沙含水弩多伤骨，田仰畲刀少用牛。\n知得共君相见否，近来魂梦转悠悠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21695.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21695","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}